#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Welcome</h3> to the tutorial course for Kolf!"
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Dobrodošli</h3> u Kolf teren za obuku!"

#~ msgid "Comment=To hit the ball, press and hold the Down Arrow or left mouse button. How long you hold down the mouse button or key determines strength of the shot."
#~ msgstr "Comment=Da biste udarili lopticu, pritisnite i držite dugme Strelica dole ili lijevo dugme miša. Snagu udarca određujete dužinom pritiska na tipku odnosno dugme miša."

#~ msgid "Comment=To aim the putter, press the Left (rotate counterclockwise) and Right (rotate clockwise) Arrow keys or use the mouse."
#~ msgstr "Comment=Da nanišanite palicom, pritisnite strelicu lijevo (rotacija suprotno kazaljci sata) ili desno (rotacija u smijeru kazaljke sata) ili koristite miš."

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Bridges</h3>Bridges can have walls on the top, bottom, left, or right."
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Mostovi</h3>Mostovi mogu imati zidove iznad, ispod, lijevo ili desno."

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Everything</h3>Here's a hole that has it all. Have fun with Kolf!<br><center>-- Jason Katz-Brown</center>"
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Svega pomalo</h3>Ovo je rupa koja ima sve. Zabavite se s Kolfom!<br><center>-- Jason Katz-Brown</center>"

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Slopes</h3>Slopes are slanted areas of ground that push the ball in the direction that they slope. This direction is shown when you choose <u>Hole->Show Info</u>."
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Nagibi</h3>Nagibi su nakošene oblasti tla koje guraju lopticu u smijeru u kojem padaju. Ovaj smjer se može vidjeti kada izaberete <u>Rupa->Prikaži informacije</u>."

#~ msgid "Comment=Hit the ball onto the slope and let it roll into cup."
#~ msgstr "Comment=Šutnite loptu prema nagibu i pustite da se spusti u rupu."

#~ msgid "Comment=Try out these different types of slopes."
#~ msgstr "Comment=Isprobajte ove razne vrste nagiba."

#~ msgid "Comment=The steepness of a slope is shown when you choose <u>Hole->Show Info</u>. Steepness goes from 8 (steepest) to 1 (shallowest)."
#~ msgstr "Comment=Stupanj nagiba možete dobiti ako izaberete <u>Rupa->Prikaži informacije</u>. Nagnutost se kreće od 8 (najveća) do 1 (najmanja)."

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Walls</h3>Bounce the ball off of the red walls."
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Zidovi</h3>Lopticu možete odbijati od crvene zidove."

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Sand</h3>Sand is yellow, and slows your ball down."
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Pijesak</h3>Pijesak je žute boje i usporava vašu lopticu."

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Puddles (Water)</h3>Hitting into a puddle (blue) adds a penalty stroke to your score, and your ball is placed outside the puddle."
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Bare (Voda)</h3>Pogodak u baru (plava boja) dodaje kaznene bodove na vaš rezultat, a loptica se premješta izvan bare."

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Windmills</h3>Windmills (brown base with moving arm) have brown walls (or half walls). The windmill arm's speed may vary by hole."
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Vjetrenjače</h3>Vjetrenjača (smeđi stub sa pokretnom rukom) ima smeđe zidove (ili polu-zidove). Ruka vjetrenjače može biti različita za svaku rupu."

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Black Holes</h3>Black Holes transport the ball to their exit, and eject it at a speed directly relational to the speed your ball was going. Choose <u>Hole->Show Info</u> to see which Black Hole goes to which exit and the direction the ball will come out at."
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Crne rupe</h3>Crne rupe transportuju lopticu do svog izlaza, te je izbacuju brzinom proporcionalnom brzini kojom je loptica ranije išla. Izaberite <u>Rupa->Pokaži informacije</u> da vidite koja Crna rupa odgovara kojem izlazu kao i smjer kojim će loptica biti izbačena."

#~ msgid "Comment=<h3>Floaters</h3>Floaters are moving platforms that carry a ball that lands on it. Floaters' speeds vary."
#~ msgstr "Comment=<h3>Plutači</h3>Plutači su pokretne platforme koje prenose lopticu koja padne na njih. Brzina plutača je promjenljiva."
